---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Math Solution & Exam Center Mymensingh.">

  <section class="gradient-bg">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto section-padding text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto card p-8 lg:p-10 space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect student names, contact numbers, class and batch information, parent or guardian names, addresses, exam answers, results, and attendance records — only what is needed to run the coaching program.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">2. How We Use It</h2>
        <p>Your information is used for enrollment, class scheduling, conducting online exams, publishing results, sending notices, and communicating with parents. We do not sell or share personal data with third parties for marketing.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">3. Data Security</h2>
        <p>Accounts are protected by passwords and access is restricted by role — students can only see their own records, and administrative functions require an admin account.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">4. Results & Photos</h2>
        <p>Merit lists and event photographs may be published on the website and gallery. Parents may request removal of a photograph by contacting the office.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may request correction or deletion of your personal information at any time by visiting the center office or contacting us through the website.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
        <p>Privacy concerns? <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700">Contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PublicLayout>
